		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Vampiric being that absorbs blood from the living, using it to assume a mortal guise.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (2d6 + absorb blood), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Absorb Blood</strong>. Target takes 1 CON damage, sayona regains 1d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. If sayona has absorbed blood within the last day, can shapechange into alluring humanoid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
